l9t5_cm5: Layer 9 record l9t5, round 4 part 3: finding SDR3-F02, the Compute Module 5's supply design figure (MESHSAT-1357)
prototype design; nothing built, bought, powered or measured; a case row's change is the coordinator's and none is made here

